    "intro_narrative": "You stand in the center of a dimly lit operations room, the air humming with the sound of cooling fans and old electronics. This was the workspace of 'The Architect,' a notorious data broker who vanished leaving behind a fortune in encrypted assets. The exit is sealed, and the only way out is to retrieve the Master Key hidden somewhere in this digital labyrinth. Around you are various terminals, secure containers, and strange processing devices. They seem dormant, waiting for the right sequence of interactions to wake up. You must trace the flow of data, manipulate the signals, and unlock the layers of security to find the prize.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
